Pin 3   MS-CAN High (possible)
Pin 4   Chassis Ground
Pin 5   Signal Ground
Pin 6   HS-CAN High

Pin11   MS-CAN Low (possible)
Pin14   HS-CAN Low
Pin16   +12V Battery

Test A
Pin 16 -> Pin 4
Expected ≈ 12V

Test B
Pin 6 -> Pin 14
Expected ≈ 60Ω (ignition OFF)

Test C
Pin 3 -> Pin 11
Expected ≈ 60Ω if MS-CAN exists

